WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.523
USER_ONE week 7: 28 contributor-painted regions. Amber identifies the selected tooth; boundaries are drafts.

00:00:03.523 --> 00:00:10.399
Choose an FDI number to select its saved painted region on either arch.

00:00:10.399 --> 00:00:14.307
Use the number selector for FDI or US numbering. US 8 selects FDI 11.

00:00:14.307 --> 00:00:18.354
Focus selected tooth brings that painted region closer. Fit scan returns to the full arches.

00:00:18.354 --> 00:00:22.140
Rotate turns the camera around the scan. Pan moves the view without changing teeth.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:24.934
Face-on restores the front view. The arch spacing is for viewing, not a measured bite.

00:00:24.934 --> 00:00:29.010
Overlay compares exploratory poses with the source. No preset movement is added; week 7 scale remains unverified.
